  "contentHtml": "<p>감각기관을 가르칠 때 스마트폰 센서와 관련하여 수업을 많이 했습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>중력센서, 자이로센서, 조도센서 등을요..</p><p>그리고 감각기관이 끝날때쯤 새로운 센서 고안하기 모둠활동을 했더니</p><p>생각보다 창의적인 아이디어가 나오더라구요.</p><p><br></p><p>학생용 활동지, 관련 동영상 등 올립니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2572854E5330DE4026\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"스마트폰센서 고안하기.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\" id=\"A_2572854E5330DE40263590\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D967%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20140325104154&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile256.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F25618B4D5330DE67306D90')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 스마트폰 센서 고안하기.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D967%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20140325104154&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile270.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F215CA74D5330DE67320BE6')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 스마트폰 센서.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v2044zVtqt7ttTTtRRt11cB\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v2044zVtqt7ttTTtRRt11cB?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InYyMDQ0elZ0cXQ3dHRUVHRSUnQxMWNCIiwidGlkIjoiYjU0ZTM4YWQtNmNhMC00MWYxLWEwNDMtNWUxNzRjYmZlYjJkIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0NDU2fQ.vBs4bwJWis-OzTQR-JZnDBcBNz2j6l4rIB5jSJutdILLgZPFZqqKS5_UIj9Lvvv3EIMgfsPs2-hQCw8Ruudl4A&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
